        "original_id": "0b052544-550f-55b1-932b-6d3c447316d6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Akshay Kumar, Nagarjuna, Pooja Bhatt, Sonali Bendre, Anu Malik, Aadesh Shrivastava\n- Films: Angaaray, Lahu Ke Do Rang, Insaaf, Daava, Tarazu, Barood, Zulmi\n- Topics: box office performance, film careers, death\n\nFacts:\n- The 1998 film Angaaray stars Akshay Kumar, Nagarjuna, Pooja Bhatt, and Sonali Bendre in lead roles.\n- The 1998 film Angaaray has music composed by Anu Malik and Aadesh Shrivastava.\n- In the 1990s, Akshay Kumar's films Lahu Ke Do Rang, Insaaf, Daava, Tarazu, Angaaray, Barood, and Zulmi performed poorly at the box office.\n- In the 1990s, the poor box office performance of Lahu Ke Do Rang, Insaaf, Daava, Tarazu, Angaaray, Barood, and Zulmi led to a setback in Akshay Kumar's film career.\n- Aadesh Shrivastava died of cancer in Kokilaben Hospital a day after he turned 51.",
